flowchart LR
    Start([Manifest request]) --> Gate{Authorized locked-team member?}
    Gate -->|No| Denied[Safe access or unavailable error]
    Gate -->|Yes| Project[Load roster and apply privacy projection]
    Project --> Canonical[Normalize, sort, and serialize]
    Canonical --> Hash[Compute SHA-256]
    Hash --> Persist[Upsert latest and deduplicate history]
    Persist --> Operation{Export or verify?}
    Operation -->|Export| Output[JSON, HTML, or PDF]
    Operation -->|Verify| Lookup{Current or historical match?}
    Lookup -->|Yes| Match[Integrity match]
    Lookup -->|No| Mismatch[Safe mismatch]
    Output --> Finish([HackMatch record, not organizer acceptance])
    Match --> Finish
    Mismatch --> Finish

    Context[Event data is compatibility record context] -.-> Project
    Excluded[Unavailable identities are pseudonymized and private data is excluded] -.-> Project

